        "filing_date": "2026-02-25",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also offer our customers a full spectrum of value-added services, such as transportation and logistics, appraisal, inspection, refurbishing, titling, loan payoff, and financial services.",
